[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    32[0m:[38;5;10m[49m | # | function | trigger (the exact invalid input/condition) | expected C result |
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    33[0m:[38;5;10m[49m |---|----------|----------------------------------------------|-------------------|
